SOAPBOX: Decided to do some casual operating for a few hours on Saturday
SOAPBOX: and Sunday. Was delighted to see/hear that 10m was in great
SOAPBOX: shape. Worked the world with my trusty Antron-99 vertical
SOAPBOX: antenna. Logged 102 DXCC, 31 zones and 585 QSOs. Not a bad effort
SOAPBOX: for a small station. Best DX was VK6T, VL3A, plus some JA, BY,
SOAPBOX: HS0, KH2. A few interesting African countries also logged,
SOAPBOX: including TL, TY and what a thrill when TZ4AM called me while I
SOAPBOX: was running. An enjoyable weekend of contesting. EI2KC
